Package: gcm4
Architecture: all
# Base GTK4 sans aucun plugin (#126, #156) : PyGObject, GTK 4 et libadwaita
# (décision D1 de #118) et loguru. Aucune dépendance de plugin (VTE,
# gtk-vnc, spice, freerdp) : chaque plugin apporte les siennes dans son
# propre paquet.
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${python3:Depends},
         python3 (>= 3.12),
         python3-gi,
         gir1.2-gtk-4.0,
         gir1.2-adw-1,
         python3-loguru
Description: tabbed connection manager (GTK4 base, no protocol plugin)
 gcm4 organizes hosts in groups and opens their connections in tabs.
 .
 This package contains the GTK4 base only: host tree with groups and
 search, host dialog, preferences, command line. It ships no connection
 plugin, so no connection can be opened until a plugin package (SSH,
 RDP, VNC...) is installed.
